# Defensive: raw HuggingFace Hub download cache (blobs/snapshots/refs) should
# never end up inside the build context. load_foundation() only ever reads
# a flat config.json + single weight file per foundation under
# src/foundation_model_weights/<foundation>/ -- see that directory's
# README.md. If HF_HOME/HF_HUB_CACHE happens to point inside this project on
# your machine, prepare_submission.py's downloads can otherwise land a full
# multi-GB hf_cache/ tree here, which COPY src/ would then pull into the
# image wholesale.
hf_cache/
**/hf_cache/
.cache/
**/blobs/
**/snapshots/
**/refs/
models--*/

# Legacy sklearn pickle heads are converted to .npz before Docker build.
*.joblib
